 "manufacturer": "Zhuhai Hongjiacheng Technology",
 "title": "SMCJ series: 1500 W surface-mount transient voltage suppressors, SMC (DO-214AB)",
 "source": {
  "revision": "Rev:2.2",
  "pages": 5
 },
 "summary": "Glass-passivated transient voltage suppressor diodes in the SMC (DO-214AB) package, each able to take a 1500 W peak from a single 10/1000 µs pulse. The range covers stand-off voltages of 5 V to 440 V with a 5 % breakdown window (A suffix), and every voltage is offered unidirectional (A) or bidirectional (CA). They are meant for clamping surges on I/O lines, supply buses and other exposed nodes in telecom, computer, industrial and consumer products.",
 "key_figures": [
  [
